# Wan2.1-VACE-1.3B inference (Wan-Video/Wan2.1 at the pinned commit, vace_pins.json): the repository's requirements.txt,
# the subset imported on the path the adapter runs (wan.WanVace: VaceWanModel, WanVAE, T5EncoderModel, the UniPC flow
# solver, VaceVideoProcessor). Open pins (">=" or none) are resolved as of the last change of the VACE code (2025-05-16,
# commit 76e94276 "Format the code"; --exclude-newer 2025-05-17), except torch / torchvision / opencv-python /
# transformers / tokenizers / accelerate / flash-attn, which are set to the versions of the sibling Wan2.1-architecture kit
# (models/skyreels_v2_df: torch 2.5.1+cu124 with sm_90 kernels and the official flash-attn release wheel for it; all inside
# the official ranges torch>=2.4.0, torchvision>=0.19.0, opencv-python>=4.9.0.80, transformers>=4.49.0, tokenizers>=0.20.3,
# accelerate>=1.1.1). Not installed (not imported on that path): dashscope (prompt extension API), gradio (demo), xfuser
# (multi-GPU USP).
